        {
          "text": "Mi ma omvi e’yo Yehova Mu­ngu miniri ma drilia kini, Ma a’bini ’ba Suriani ndra ’yepi avipi rari; eri si ndra Misiria, ovu ’daa, yi lamiru, yi ma kalafe ga; ’dale eri ofu sururu, ambo, okpo be, ’ba be karakarau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
